     1,
     "\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\">\r\n    Olá a todos/as,<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    Estou a tentar correr uma simulacao usando o package &quot;data.table&quot;. O\r\n    conjunto de dados é grande. O exemplo em baixo demonstra uma\r\n    dificuldade que estou a sentir<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <pre><code><span>DT </span><span>=</span><span> data.table</span><span>(</span><span>a</span><span>=</span><span>sample</span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span>:</span><span>2</span><span>),</span><span> b</span><span>=</span><span>sample</span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span>:</span><span>1000</span><span>,</span><span>20</span><span>))</span><span>\r\n</span><span>&gt;</span><span> DT\r\n   a   b\r\n</span><span>1</span><span>:</span><span>  </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>440</span><span>\r\n</span><span>2</span><span>:</span><span>  </span><span>1</span><span>   </span><span>5</span><span>\r\n</span><span>3</span><span>:</span><span>  </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>795</span><span>\r\n</span><span>4</span><span>:</span><span>  </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>138</span><span>\r\n</span><span>5</span><span>:</span><span>  </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>941</span><span>\r\n</span><span>6</span><span>:</span><span>  </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>929</span><span>\r\n</span><span>7</span><span>:</span><span>  </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>759</span><span>\r\n</span><span>8</span><span>:</span><span>  </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>192</span><span>\r\n</span><span>9</span><span>:</span><span>  </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>994</span><span>\r\n</span><span>10</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>176</span><span>\r\n</span><span>11</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>152</span><span>\r\n</span><span>12</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>893</span><span>\r\n</span><span>13</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>2</span><span>  </span><span>28</span><span>\r\n</span><span>14</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>884</span><span>\r\n</span><span>15</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>467</span><span>\r\n</span><span>16</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>761</span><span>\r\n</span><span>17</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>879</span><span>\r\n</span><span>18</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>964</span><span>\r\n</span><span>19</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>802</span><span>\r\n</span><span>20</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>271</span></code></pre>\r\n    <p>O que pretendo é efectuar uma amostragem aleatoria (exemplo, n=3\r\n      no grupo a==1 e n=5 no grupo a==2 e obter algo como isto<br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <pre><code><span> a   b\r\n</span><span>1</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>440</span><span>\r\n</span><span>2</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>879</span><span>\r\n</span><span>3</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>994</span><span>\r\n</span><span>4</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>152</span><span>\r\n</span><span>5</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>2</span><span> </span><span>879</span><span>\r\n</span><span>6</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>884</span><span>\r\n</span><span>7</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>964</span><span>\r\n</span><span>8</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>929</span></code></pre>\r\n    <p>usando uma estrutura data.table. O exemplo real envolve varios\r\n      milhares de linhas  (centenas de grupos com dimensao da amostra\r\n      bastante variavel). Alguém tem alguma proposta? tentei<br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>DT[, sample(.N, size=c(5,3)), by=a]<br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    mas obtenho 5 amostras em ambos os grupos (pretendia 3 no segundo\r\n    grupo).<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    Obrigado,<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    Nuno<br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <br>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
   ]
